  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment Mobilization for Solar PV and Sustainable Housing in the Caribbean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program contributes to the design, structuring and financing of the Eastern Caribbean Solar Challenge and Saint Lucia Green Affordable Housing projects,  adding 6 MWp of PV capacity across the OECS region and providing resilient housing to 12,000 Saint Lucia&#xB4;s citizens.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program delivers demand-led technical assistance to the OECS Commission and the Government of Saint Lucia to design, structure and finance the priority flagship &#x201C;Eastern Caribbean Solar Challenge&#x201D; and &#x201C;Green Affordable Housing&#x201D; projects to increase the resilience of the housing and energy infrastructure sectors. Two Outcomes: 1) Green Affordable Housing project, 2) Caribbean Solar Challenge project</narrative>
  </description>
